  Easy names at home

  ╭───────────────╮      ╭────────╮      ╭───────────────╮
  │ phones        │──────│ router │──────│ this computer │
  │ TVs · laptops │      ╰───┬────╯      │ movies.local  │
  ╰───────────────╯      internet ✗      ╰───────────────╯

  Easy names will let you open each App with a short name like movies.local instead of numbers. A
  small web server on this computer, Caddy, will answer to the names. They will work only on your
  home network.

  Not available yet
  This option is coming soon. For now your Apps stay where they are, and choosing it changes
  nothing.

  Which names?
  Each App will get its own name, like movies.local, so you type words instead of numbers. Phones,
  TVs and laptops on your network look the names up on their own.

  The internet
  Nobody on the internet will be able to use these names to reach your Apps. They will work only
  on your home network.

